(35,55,'WooCommerce','','','','2026-04-05 12:05:09','2026-04-05 12:05:09','Campsite booking: could not read stay dates on line item(s) 16. Open the order line in WooCommerce and confirm MWB/booking meta exists, or re-checkout using the [vila_campsite_booking] form.\n\nDebug (vila-campsite-booking):\nLine item ID 16, product ID 22.\nVila meta: _vila_cb_check_in=(empty); _vila_cb_check_out=(empty) (both must be valid Y-m-d).\nVila validation: check-in invalid; check-out invalid.\nMWB keys used: (none — no From/To pair found on item).\nAlso read wc_get_order_item_meta() for _mwb_bfwp_* and _wps_single_cal_*.\nMWB raw from: (empty)\nMWB raw to: (empty)\nMWB: missing from and/or to — nothing to parse.\nWP Settings → General: date_format=F j, Y',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),
(36,55,'WooCommerce','','','','2026-04-05 12:05:09','2026-04-05 12:05:09','Payment to be made upon delivery. Order status changed from Pending payment to Processing.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),
(37,56,'WooCommerce','','','','2026-04-05 12:07:26','2026-04-05 12:07:26','Campsite booking: could not read stay dates on line item(s) 17. Open the order line in WooCommerce and confirm MWB/booking meta exists, or re-checkout using the [vila_campsite_booking] form.\n\nDebug (vila-campsite-booking):\nLine item ID 17, product ID 22.\nVila meta: _vila_cb_check_in=(empty); _vila_cb_check_out=(empty) (both must be valid Y-m-d).\nVila validation: check-in invalid; check-out invalid.\nMWB keys used: (none — no From/To pair found on item).\nAlso read wc_get_order_item_meta() for _mwb_bfwp_* and _wps_single_cal_*.\nMWB raw from: (empty)\nMWB raw to: (empty)\nMWB: missing from and/or to — nothing to parse.\nWP Settings → General: date_format=F j, Y\nHint: nothing was saved on this line at checkout. Common causes: order created in wp-admin (cart validation does not run); product added without the booking form / dates; or a checkout bug prevented cart data from copying (update the plugin — a post-checkout backfill runs when possible).',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),
